12-## Customizing your theme
13-
14:If you want to change things like your color palette, spacing scale, typography scale, or breakpoints, add your customizations using the `@theme` directive in your CSS:
15-
16-```css
17-/* [!code filename:CSS] */
18-@theme {
19-  --font-display: "Satoshi", "sans-serif";
20-
21:  --breakpoint-3xl: 120rem;
22-
23-  --color-avocado-100: oklch(0.99 0 0);
24-  --color-avocado-200: oklch(0.98 0.04 113.22);
25-  --color-avocado-300: oklch(0.94 0.11 115.03);
26-  --color-avocado-400: oklch(0.92 0.19 114.08);
27-  --color-avocado-500: oklch(0.84 0.18 117.33);
--
113-  <!-- ... -->
114-</div>
115-```
