117-### Arbitrary variants
118-
119:Arbitrary _variants_ are like arbitrary values but for doing on-the-fly selector modification, like you can with built-in pseudo-class variants like `hover:{utility}` or responsive variants like `md:{utility}` but using square bracket notation directly in your HTML.
