259-Traditionally these would be classes like `card`, `btn`, `badge` — that kind of thing.
260-
261-```css
262-/* [!code filename:CSS] */
263-/* [!code highlight:2] */
264:@layer components {
265-  .card {
266-    background-color: var(--color-white);
267-    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
268-    padding: --spacing(6);
269-    box-shadow: var(--shadow-xl);
270-  }
